---
title: SD-01 Authentication - Login
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Auth API
    participant S as AuthService
    participant D as SQL Server
    U->>F: Enter username + password
    F->>A: POST /api/auth/login
    A->>S: Login(username, password)
    S->>D: Find user + role
    D-->>S: User record
    S->>S: Check IsActive + verify password hash
    alt Invalid credentials or inactive user
        S-->>A: Failure
        A-->>F: 401 Unauthorized
        F-->>U: Show "Invalid username or password"
    else Valid
        S-->>A: JWT (userId, role)
        A-->>F: 200 OK + token
        F-->>U: Redirect to dashboard
    end
    Note over F,A: Token is sent as Bearer header on every later request
